{"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate ","type":"text"},{"code":"GCWidgetSDK","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in under five minutes.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Getting started","modules":[{"name":"GCWidgetSDK"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GCWidgetSDK"},{"type":"text","text":" exposes a single entry point — "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.gamechange.GCWidgetSDK\/documentation\/GCWidgetSDK\/GcWidgetSDK\/shared","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a one-line method call to open the chat UI. The SDK handles authentication,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contact identification, and the full visual flow; the host app simply"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"decides "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"when"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to open the widget."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"1. Link the framework","anchor":"1-Link-the-framework","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GCWidgetSDK.framework"},{"type":"text","text":" to your app target’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Frameworks, Libraries,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and Embedded Content"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" list. Make sure it’s set to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Embed & Sign"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" so the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bundled Noto Sans fonts and image assets ship with your app."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The framework deploys at "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"iOS 18.0"}]},{"type":"text","text":"; raise your app’s deployment target"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to match."}]},{"level":2,"text":"2. Import and open the widget","type":"heading","anchor":"2-Import-and-open-the-widget"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import GCWidgetSDK","","final class SupportButton: UIViewController {","    @IBAction func contactSupportTapped(_ sender: Any) {","        GcWidgetSDK.shared.initializeSDK(","            viewController: self,","            name: currentUser.displayName,","            email: currentUser.email,","            phone: currentUser.phoneNumber","        )","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Any of the identity fields are optional. Pass what you know; the SDK will","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reuse values from a previous session when you omit them.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"3. (Optional) Update the contact off-session","type":"heading","anchor":"3-Optional-Update-the-contact-off-session"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the host app learns new details between support openings, push them to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the backend without reopening the widget:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["GcWidgetSDK.shared.setUser(","    name: \"Jane Merchant\",","    email: \"jane@example.com\",","    phone: nil",")"]},{"level":2,"text":"4. Check whether the widget has been used","type":"heading","anchor":"4-Check-whether-the-widget-has-been-used"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.gamechange.GCWidgetSDK\/documentation\/GCWidgetSDK\/GcWidgetSDK\/isUserLoggedIn","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" after the first successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"call to "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.gamechange.GCWidgetSDK\/documentation\/GCWidgetSDK\/GcWidgetSDK\/initializeSDK(viewController:token:name:email:phone:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Useful for deciding whether to show a first-run explainer before opening"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the widget, or for automatic re-open flows on cold start."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["if GcWidgetSDK.shared.isUserLoggedIn {","    GcWidgetSDK.shared.initializeSDK(viewController: self)","} else {","    presentOnboardingThenOpenSupport()","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"What the user sees","level":2,"anchor":"What-the-user-sees"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"initializeSDK"},{"type":"text","text":" is called the user lands on the welcome screens"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(onboarding) and then navigates into the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.gamechange.GCWidgetSDK\/documentation\/GCWidgetSDK\/ConversationList","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", where they"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can search existing threads, filter by topic, tap a row to open the chat,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or start a new conversation."}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.gamechange.GCWidgetSDK\/documentation\/GCWidgetSDK"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gcwidgetsdk\/gettingstarted"]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.gamechange.GCWidgetSDK\/documentation\/GCWidgetSDK\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://com.gamechange.GCWidgetSDK/documentation/GCWidgetSDK/GcWidgetSDK/isUserLoggedIn":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"isUserLoggedIn"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIden